Package: prepDNAm
Title: Preprocessing and Quality Control of Illumina DNA Methylation Array
    Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Chiara", "Herzog", , "ch2151@cam.ac.uk", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-1572-498X"))
Description: Takes raw IDAT files, signal-intensity tables (e.g. from GEO)
    or beta matrices through normalisation, sample and probe filtering and
    imputation to an analysis-ready beta matrix, with a resumable,
    per-batch workflow and an interactive HTML QC report.
